 r←Test_TableEdit_201(stopFlag batchFlag);parms;n;⎕TRAP;table;rowTitles
⍝ Test quitting the table editor. Changes are made and the user shall be prompted and will press "No".
 r←T._Inactive
 :Return

 r←T._Failed
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')

 table←⍪'Obama' 'Bush' 'Clinton' 'Reagan' 'Kennedy'
 table,←'Barak' 'George' 'Bill' 'Ronald' 'John'
 table,←?5 10⍴1000000
 parms←#.APLGUI.APLGUI.Table.CreateParms
 parms.posn←35 25
 parms.size←400 600
 parms.caption←'Test_TableEdit_201: check "Close" with changes not accepted by user'
 parms.confirmQuit←1
 parms.testMode←1
 parms.testParms←1 2⍴'AskFor_SaveChanges'(('autoPress' 1)('timeout' 0.1))

 n←#.APLGUI.APLGUI.Table.Create table #.APLGUI.APLGUI.APLGuiGlobalParms.CreateDefaults parms
 n.Grid ∆KeyPress'Ford'         ⍝ we need a change
 n.Grid ∆KeyPress⊂'ER'          ⍝ Make it permanent
 ∆Process n.∆Form
 1 ⎕NQ n.∆Form'Close'
 0.1 ∆Process n.∆Form

 →T.GoToTidyUp table≢n.∆result

 r←T._OK

∆TidyUp:
 n.∆CloseForm
